WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.892 --> 00:00:19.709
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.709 --> 00:00:27.007
Tap Instructor, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:27.007 --> 00:00:30.202
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.202 --> 00:00:34.428
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.428 --> 00:00:40.434
Type your six digits.

6
00:00:40.434 --> 00:00:45.809
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.809 --> 00:00:51.382
This is the Instructor Panel. Five tabs across the top.

8
00:00:51.382 --> 00:00:57.917
The dashboard opens on today — the bar at the top says so.

9
00:00:57.917 --> 00:01:05.094
The arrows step back one day at a time.

10
00:01:05.094 --> 00:01:10.810
The date changes, and so does everything under it.

11
00:01:10.810 --> 00:01:18.045
For a day further back, tap the date itself.

12
00:01:18.045 --> 00:01:23.755
A dot marks every day somebody checked in.

13
00:01:23.755 --> 00:01:28.445
Pick a day to jump straight to it.

14
00:01:28.445 --> 00:01:36.867
Or tap Today to come back.
